eason-2-spoilers-raelle-abigail-scylla-finale-interview"}, {"title": "Fort Salem’ Season 2 Spoilers On Raelle, Abigail, Scylla – Hollywood Life", "url": "https://dashathome.duchenneuk.org/fort-salem-season-2-spoilers-on-raelle-abigail-scylla-hollywood-life.html"}, {"title": "motherland fort salem season 1 episode 10 witchbomb season finale recap review with spoilers", "url": "https://wherever-i-look.com/tv-shows/motherland-fort-salem-season-1-episode-10-witchbomb-season-finale-recap-review-with-spoilers"}, {"title": "'Motherland: Fort Salem' Star Taylor Hickson Teases \"Infinite\" Possibilities for Season 3 (EXCLUSIVE)", "url": "https://jira.phpfox.com/p/motherland-fort-salem-season-3"}, {"title": "Motherland: Fort Salem Episode 10 Review – Witchbomb", "url": "https://www.denofgeek.com/?p=590193"}, {"title": "Motherland: Fort Salem Creator on What’s Brewing for Season 2", "url": "https://www.denofgeek.com/?p=591404"}, {"title": "Motherland: Fort Salem 2×07 Review: “Irrevocable”", "url": "https://thegeekiary.com/?p=99397"}]}, "The search confirms the premise. The season 1 finale, \"Witchbomb,\" aired May 20, 2020, and closed by revealing that Willa is alive. Coverage consistently describes it as a cliffhanger rather than a payoff.\n\n- **The reveal:** One outlet says the final seconds showed Willa is not dead after all. Another notes that Scylla walks into a Spree safehouse and finds a Spree leader, who is none other than Willa Collar.\n- **Earlier clues:** Viewers were set up for this. A flashback showed Willa saying goodbye and passing on her protection charm to her daughter, which suggested she expected not to return.\n- **Creator's account:** Showrunner Eliot Laurence said the twist was late in the game, and that it later had some deepening threads for season 2.\n- **Season 2 follow-up:** Willa's Spree role became a major storyline. Season 2 later shows her and Scylla working together to rescue Raelle from the Camarilla.\n- **Other finale twist:** Raelle and Abigail survive a black-matter explosion, and one source reports that the duo created it.\n\nA caveat: one review criticized how quickly the reveal landed, noting that Raelle finding out that her mother was alive took place a mere couple of seconds before losing her again. The sources are fan and entertainment outlets, not official Freeform material."], "durationSeconds": 7.105013, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01GmuVXqr7TUPsvb2dkvWBAz", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
